## Phase 2 — Evidence and submission

### T8. Evidence collection

**Depends on:** T6.

**What to do:** an "attach evidence to a dispute" API for projects, plus `EvidenceRequirements` — a template per (network, raw reason code) pair describing what the system supplies and what the project must supply.

The system supplies on its own: AVS/CVV result, 3DS status and liability shift, buyer IP, authorization timestamp, payment history for that card, descriptor.

The project must supply: proof of delivery or service, customer correspondence, ToS with acceptance record, cancellation policy, cancellation confirmation.

**Done when:** three different pairs (Visa 13.1, Mastercard 4837, Visa 10.4) yield three different requirement sets.

